{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13224400","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224400","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322440001:1":{"text":"我们生在这片土地上从来没有真正幸福过，寒冷，饥饿，贫穷从来没有远离我们！","source_cn":"我们生在这片土地上从来没有真正幸福过，寒冷，饥饿，贫穷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB9D342ECE3F8C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322440002:0":{"text":"我们受苦的时候艾雅在哪里？你是否跟我一样怀疑过艾雅从未真正关注过我们！因为祂并不是我们的神！","source_cn":"我们受苦的时候艾雅在哪里？你是否跟我一样怀疑过艾雅从未...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF816A38AFC5C8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322440003:1":{"text":"赞美伟大真神，只有伟大意志才会指引我们！","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神，只有伟大意志才会指引我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C26530C87842B45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322440004:1":{"text":"赞美伟大真神！","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95674434202EEFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439001:":{"text":"你们感到虚弱","source_cn":"你们感到虚弱","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ADAE30D80F645C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439002:":{"text":"因为你们是肉体凡躯！","source_cn":"因为你们是肉体凡躯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5771BDF45720833F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439003:":{"text":"信仰伟大真神！","source_cn":"信仰伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x108880FC5F5E0FF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439004:":{"text":"引渡我们的灵魂！","source_cn":"引渡我们的灵魂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561228FB3FEEBEE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322440005:1":{"text":"引导者大人，我们抓到了一位异教徒，该如何处置？","source_cn":"引导者大人，我们抓到了一位异教徒，该如何处置？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71228625164ABA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322440006:1":{"text":"别这样说，根本不存在什么异教徒，他们只是短暂的迷失了方向的人而已。","source_cn":"别这样说，根本不存在什么异教徒，他们只是短暂的迷失了方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9598E659B398D020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322440007:1":{"text":"看着我，孩子，我能帮助你做些什么吗？","source_cn":"看着我，孩子，我能帮助你做些什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B6CAEB8F64971B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322440008:1":{"text":"我……我……捉、找人……","source_cn":"我……我……捉、找人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F201471EE1E323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322440009:1":{"text":"你说什么？捉人？难道是来找事的？！","source_cn":"你说什么？捉人？难道是来找事的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43902165FDD3C2E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322440010:1":{"text":"冷静，她只是口齿不清罢了。","source_cn":"冷静，她只是口齿不清罢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DEFCE758CF9D4F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322440011:1":{"text":"找……找列夫哥哥……","source_cn":"找……找列夫哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA790A1E245827B5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322440012:1":{"text":"你的意思是，来找列夫的吗？哈！原来你就是伊琳娜是吗！","source_cn":"你的意思是，来找列夫的吗？哈！原来你就是伊琳娜是吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1B60AB47C534BC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t